        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: মাঝি",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মাঝি — mājhi — \"a boatman\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "বুড়ো মাঝি নৌকায় বসে গান গাইছিল। buṛo mājhi noukāy bôse gān gāichhilô. The old boatman sat in the boat, singing."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The মাঝি (mājhi)'s river songs are a whole branch of Bengali folk music."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "মাঝি (mājhi) is inherited: CDIAL lists Bengali māji, \"a steersman\", under the reconstructed majjhika, \"a boatman\" (CDIAL 9714). It is not filed under mádhya, middle, the source of মাঝ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for getting around."
            }
